{"availability":"available","full":"waltstephen/UMM-Reflection","name":"UMM-Reflection","description":"Learning Native Reflection in Unified Models: reflection SFT and multi-round Flow-GRPO RL for BAGEL","category":"Education","language":"Python","stars":31,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-27T15:27:45Z","updated":"2026-09-29T04:01:24Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://waltstephen.github.io/UMM-Reflection/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T19:08:53.160Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T19:08:53.160Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T19:08:53.160Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T21:55:12.218Z","discoveredVia":[{"kind":"x","name":"As Seen On X.com","url":"https://x.com/i/web/status/2104974837961937017","postId":"2104974837961937017","postedAt":"2026-09-29T16:41:24.000Z"}],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T19:04:22.051Z","stars":29,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T21:55:12.218Z","stars":30,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T19:08:53.160Z","stars":31,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["[]( [](paper/UMM-Reflection.pdf) [](#citation) []( []( []( [](LICENSE)","UMM-Reflection teaches a unified understanding-and-generation model (BAGEL-7B-MoT) to look at its own image, decide whether it is done, and, if not, write an edit and render a corrected image, all inside one model and one context. Reinforcement learning runs on complete reflection trajectories: sibling trajectories share one first image, so the group-relative advantage compares reflection strategies, and one trajectory-level advantage updates both the reflection tokens and the flow-based revisions. No critic or verifier is used at inference."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/waltstephen/UMM-Reflection/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"fbe32104aca0c21617f94121fe86ba6b2ba5d4062003b6a0c1ef580cb39056e5","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T10:25:25.182Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T21:55:12.218Z","proje